STATEMENT OF CHANGES (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following changes were made to the original work:

1. FORMAT CONVERSION
   The original model weights (model.safetensors, bfloat16) were converted to
   the GGUF format using llama.cpp's convert_hf_to_gguf.py at build b10568
   (commit af9df75).

   - model-f16.gguf    : full-precision (f16) GGUF of the language model
   - mmproj-f16.gguf   : f16 GGUF of the vision projector (mmproj)

2. QUANTIZATION
   Two quantized variants of the language model were produced with
   llama-quantize:

   - model-q8_0.gguf   : Q8_0  (8.52 BPW, 795 MB)
   - model-q4_k_m.gguf : Q4_K_M (5.50 BPW, 517 MB)

   The vision projector (mmproj) was intentionally left unquantized (f16),
   following llama.cpp convention.

3. NO WEIGHT MODIFICATION BEYOND QUANTIZATION
   No fine-tuning, pruning, merging, or any other modification of the model
   parameters was performed. The quantization is lossy compression of the
   original weights.

4. ADDED FILES
   Benchmark scripts, evaluation results, and documentation are new works by
   the author of this repository (xzl01) and are provided under the same
   Apache License 2.0.

